# Tailscale ACL Configuration for LLM Proxy Rotator
# ===================================================
# Add this configuration to your Tailscale Admin Console ACL JSON
# to lock down proxy endpoints to authorized clients only.

{
  "tags": {
    "tag:llm-client": ["admin@yourdomain.com"],
    "tag:proxy-nodes": ["admin@yourdomain.com"]
  },
  "acls": [
    {
      "action": "accept",
      "src": ["tag:llm-client"],
      "dst": ["tag:proxy-nodes:1055"]
    }
  ]
}

## Setup Instructions:
# 1. Replace "admin@yourdomain.com" with your actual Tailscale user email
# 2. Copy this entire block into your Tailscale Admin Console → Settings → ACLs
# 3. On each of your four gateway nodes, run:
#    tailscaled --socks5-server=0.0.0.0:1055
#
# 4. Verify the SOCKS5 proxy is listening:
#    netstat -tlnp | grep 1055
#
# 5. Test connectivity from your client machine:
#    curl --socks5-hostname 100.64.0.1:1055 https://api.openai.com/v1/models
